# Served by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. GitHub Pages, which publishes
# keepitil.com today, ignores this file. The values are still the site policy.
#
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy is same-origin-allow-popups, not same-origin.
# apply.html starts Google and Apple sign-in through Supabase OAuth, the iOS
# app is a Capacitor WebView (404.html and keepitil-shell.js), and checkout
# leaves this origin for Shopify and for the Stripe payment link. same-origin
# would sever window.opener on those cross-origin popups.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
